    "title": "Thunder vs 76ers highlights: Jared McCain, OKC extend win streak to 12 games",
    "text": "Updated March 23, 2026, 8:44 p.m. CTPHILADELPHIA — Shai Gilgeous-Alexander and the OKC Thunder will visit VJ Edgecombe and the Philadelphia 76ers at 6 p.m. CT Monday.OKC (56-15) extended its league-best winning streak to 11 with a 132-111 road victory over the Washington Wizards on Saturday. Philadelphia (39-32) earned a 126-116 road win over the Utah Jazz on Saturday.Follow along for live updates throughout today's Thunder-76ers game:Order new book on Thunder's run to NBA titleThunder vs 76ers score updates[ LISTEN UP: Make the \"Thunder Buddies\" podcast a staple of your starting lineup by following onApple,Spotify andYouTube. ]Final: Thunder 123, 76ers 103 | OKC extends win streak to 12 gamesShai Gilgeous-Alexander: 22 points and 5 assistsChet Holmgren: 17 points and 9 reboundsJalen Williams: 18 points and 6 assistsJared McCain: 13 points and 2 assistsOKC (57-15) has won 12 straight games. It'll finish its road trip with a game against Boston at 6:30 p.m. CT Wednesday.End of the third quarter: Thunder 97, 76ers 79 | SGA extends 20-point streakShai Gilgeous-Alexander: 22 points and 5 assistsJaylin Williams: 18 points and 5 reboundsIsaiah Hartenstein: 10 points and 9 reboundsHalftime: Thunder 65, 76ers 43 | OKC rolling in Jalen Williams' return from injuryJaylin Williams: 12 points and 2 assistsShai Gilgeous-Alexander: 11 points and 2 assistsChet Holmgren: 7 points and 7 reboundsJalen Williams: 8 points and 4 assistsEnd of the first quarter: Thunder 35, 76ers 25 | Jared McCain makes two early 3-pointers in return to PhillyShai Gilgeous-Alexander: 8 points and 1 stealJared McCain: 6 pointsChet Holmgren: 5 points and 2 assistsVJ Edgecombe leads Philadelphia with 8 points and 2 assists. Thunder starting lineup tonight vs 76ersHere are OKC’s starters vs. Philadelphia:Shai Gilgeous-AlexanderLu DortJalen WilliamsChet HolmgrenIsaiah HartensteinJalen Williams is not coming off the bench in his return from injury.What time is Thunder vs 76ers game tonight?Date: Monday, March 23Time: 6 p.m. CTWhere: Xfinity Mobile Arena in PhiladelphiaWatch Thunder vs 76ers live on FuboWhat channel is OKC Thunder vs Philadelphia 76ers on tonight?TV: FanDuel Sports NetworkHow to watch online: Fubo (free trial)Thunder vs 76ers predictions, picksJustin Martinez: OKC 118, Philadelphia 101OKC will be as close to full strength as it has been all season. Jalen Williams is back after missing the last 16 games due to a right hamstring strain. Lu Dort is back after missing the last two games due to rest and a left knee contusion. And while the only exception is Ajay Mitchell, who's serving a one-game suspension, the Thunder has no shortage of backcourt depth. It's all coming together for OKC, which is on an 11-game winning streak. And I expect it to continue to roll against a short-handed Philadelphia team.Thunder vs 76ers betting oddsOdds via BetMGM as of Sunday, March 22Odds: Thunder by 15.5Over/under: 222.5Moneyline: OKC -1200 | Philadelphia +750Thunder vs 76ers injury updatesThunder: Ajay Mitchell (league suspension) is out. Payton Sandfort (G League two-way) is out. Thomas Sorber (right ACL surgical recovery) is out. Nikola Topić (G League assignment) is out.76ers: Dominick Barlow (left ankle sprain) is doubtful. Johni Broome (right knee surgery recovery) is out. Joel Embiid (right oblique strain) is out. Paul George (league suspension) is out. Tyrese Maxey (right finger tendon strain) is out. Kelly Oubre Jr. (left elbow sprain) is out.Projected OKC Thunder startersShai Gilgeous-AlexanderLu DortJalen WilliamsChet HolmgrenIsaiah HartensteinProjected Philadelphia 76ers startersQuentin GrimesVJ EdgecombeJustin EdwardsTrendon WatfordAdem BonaJustin Martinez covers the Thunder and NBA for The Oklahoman. Have a story idea for Justin? He can be reached at jmartinez@oklahoman.com or on X/Twitter at @Justintohoops. Sign up for the Thunder Sports Minute newsletter to access more NBA coverage. Support Justin's work and that of other Oklahoman journalists by purchasing a digital subscription today at subscribe.oklahoman.com.Our team of savvy editors independently handpicks all recommendations. If you purchase through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices were accurate at the time of publication but may change.",
